@startuml Notizen Custom Tab OAuth
autonumber
actor User
participant WebView as WV
participant Android as A
participant "Chrome Custom Tab" as CT
participant "Notizen backend" as S
participant "Google / Discord" as P
User -> WV: Continue with provider
WV -> A: Trusted-origin SIGN_IN message
A -> A: Generate verifier and S256 challenge
A -> CT: /android-signin?provider=...&code_challenge=...
CT -> S: Start Auth.js login with handoff destination
S -> CT: Provider authorization URL + verification cookies
CT -> P: Authenticate and consent
P -> CT: Redirect to /api/auth/callback/{provider}
CT -> S: Provider callback + original verification cookies
S -> P: Validate and exchange authorization code
P -> S: Provider tokens / identity
S -> CT: Session cookie + redirect to /api/android-callback
CT -> S: Authenticated handoff request + challenge
S -> S: Store one-time code bound to challenge (60 seconds)
S -> CT: Package-targeted intent link, with clickable fallback
CT -> A: notizen://auth?code=...
A -> S: POST /api/exchange {code, code_verifier}
S -> S: Atomically validate expiry / challenge and consume code
S -> A: Session Set-Cookie headers
A -> WV: Await cookie writes, flush, then load /notes
@enduml
